INT. MARRIOTT SUITES - 4TH FLOOR CORRIDOR - NIGHT

fluorescent light. carpet the colour of a bruise. a room service cart abandoned outside 412. COREY, DANI, BEX, MARCUS and LENA stand in a loose knot outside the conference suite, lanyards still on, name tags crooked, the team retreat is in its third hour of "synergy".

COREY
ok but nobody says anything to Greg.

DANI
nobody's saying anything to Greg.

COREY
because last time somebody said something to Greg we all got a mindfulness seminar.

BEX
i liked the mindfulness seminar.

MARCUS
Bex, they made us hold hands with the interns.

BEX
it was grounding. also i'm allowed to like things.

LENA
Bex is allowed to like things.

BEX
thank you Lena. they are the only one who gets it.

ON PHONE: A message from "GREG (VP)" lights up Corey's screen. "great energy team!! back in 5 for the breakout"

COREY
he said breakout. Dani. he said breakout.

DANI
no. no no no. we did the breakout.

MARCUS
that was the pre-breakout.

LENA
what's the difference between a breakout and a pre-breakout

MARCUS
the pre-breakout has snacks.

BEX
i'm not going back in. i'm going to stay in the hall and become a plant.

DANI
Bex you literally can't. you're presenting the deck.

BEX
Dani, they, i mean i, i have never once presented the deck. you're confusing me with the other Bex.

COREY
there's another Bex?

BEX
no. i just wanted to see if you'd check.

ON PHONE: A second message, group chat "RETREAT 2K24 (DO NOT MUTE)". Lena: "dont look but greg is at the elevator". Marcus: "he's crying???" Dani: "happy crying or layoff crying"

They all turn at once. At the far end of the corridor, the elevator dings. GREG, 50s, vest, lanyard, a laminated agenda, steps out wiping his eyes with a tiny hotel napkin.

LENA
(whispering)
Layoff crying.

MARCUS
Happy crying doesn't wear a vest.

COREY
Everybody act normal. Dani, normal.

DANI
i'm so normal. i am the normalest.

BEX
(slowly raising a hand)
hi Greg.

Greg looks up. A beat. He sniffles.

GREG
Team. Great. Love it. Love the energy.

He walks past them into the suite and the door sighs shut. They stand in the corridor in silence.

MARCUS
So. Breakout.

COREY
Breakout.

They don't move. The cart rattles faintly as the building settles.
